OL,3,GNEWSADig reveals walls of hidden
OL,4,Amedieval village
OL,5,
OL,6,FArchaeologists have uncovered walls of
OL,7,Fa lost medieval village during a
OL,8,Fweek-long community dig at Barn Pool at
OL,9,FMount Edgcumbe.
OL,11,FThey have been showing visitors finds
OL,12,Ffrom a neolithic grinding tool, World
OL,13,FWar Two American lapel pins and three
OL,14,FRoman coins.
OL,16,FThe village of West Stonehouse in south
OL,17,Feast Cornwall was sacked by the Bretons
OL,18,Fin 1338 and rebuilt before it was
OL,19,Fdestroyed in 1740 by the Earl of Mount
OL,20,FEdgcumbe.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
